.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-ENV 5
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-env
.Nd zdots environment variable contract
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Zdots behavior is controlled by `.zdots.env`, `.zdots.local`, shell state, and
service-specific environment variables. `.zdots.local` is for machine-local
overrides and is not tracked.
.Sh CORE VARIABLES
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_DATABASE_URL_OVERRIDE
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CONTEXT
Machine context, commonly `home` or `work`.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE
AI mode: `local`, `cloud`, or `none`.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
Chat endpoint. Default `http://127.0.0.1:11500`.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_EMBED_ENDPOINT
Embedding endpoint. Default `http://127.0.0.1:11501`.
.It Ev ZDOTS_DATABASE_URL
Application DB URL.
.It Ev ZDOTS_MIGRATION_URL
Migration DB URL.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CAPTURE_ENABLED
Session capture gate.
.It Ev ZDOTS_HISTORY_REDACT
History redaction gate.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CMD_ANALYTICS
Command analytics gate.
.It Ev ZDOTS_DB_ENCRYPTION_KEY
PHI column encryption key.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width .zdots.secrets.example
.It Pa .zdots.env
Tracked defaults.
.It Pa .zdots.local
Machine-local overrides.
.It Pa .zdots.work
Work-machine safety overrides.
.It Pa .zdots.secrets.example
Keychain-backed secret loader example.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-phi-safety 7 ,
.Xr zdots-ai-stack 7
